ght you said you were going back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_20","text":"I found an unidentified strand of curly hair on the floor of the shower. Should I give it to you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_21","text":"Would you please just leave? I'm begging you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_22","text":"On the way back, I discovered that Shifty was injured.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_23","text":"I decided to stop by while I was treating her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_24","text":"Shifty got hurt?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_25","text":"Could it have been from the battle?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_26","text":"In a way, yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_27","text":"She sprained her ankle while coming down from the tower after the fight.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_28","text":"... So in other words, not during the battle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_29","text":"I gave her some pain relief medication, and we'll rest here for a bit before leaving.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_30","text":"I head further inside my room,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_foolburstday_01","bgArt":"eventscene_foolburstday_01","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_31","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_31","text":"and see that Shifty is lying down on the bed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_inwonderland","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_32","text":"I'm sorry. I just need to rest for a little while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_33","text":"Did you sprain it badly?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_34","text":"No, I should be good to go in 10 minutes or so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_35","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_35","text":"Apparently Shifty is made of tough stuff.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_36","text":"Don't just stand there, Human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_37","text":"Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_38","text":"This is the perfect opportunity to give Shifty a foot massage under the pretense of muscle relaxation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_39","text":"Do it now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_40","text":"Why don't you just go home?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_41","text":"Shifty, Human says he'll give you a massage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_42","text":"Is that okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_43","text":"Huh? N-no. I don't want to impose...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_44","text":"He says massages are his specialty.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_45","text":"Oh... well, if it's not too much trouble.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_46","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_46","text":"... Sure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_47","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_47","text":"I massage Shifty's foot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_foolburstday_02","bgArt":"eventscene_foolburstday_02","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_48","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_48","text":"It's slightly swollen, which tells me she did in fact hurt herself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_49","text":"Ow, that hurts a bit, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_50","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_50","text":"I lessen the pressure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_51","text":"Hehe, now it tickles.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_52","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_52","text":"I press a little harder.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_53","text":"Ow, now it hurts again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_54","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_54","text":"Less pressure again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_55","text":"Hehehe, I told you, that tickles.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_56","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_56","text":"... Quite a finicky customer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_57","text":"How does it feel?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty_s","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_58","text":"I think it feels a little better. He's really good at massages.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_59","text":"He's definitely a pro. There's no telling how much bare skin he's touched in the past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_60","text":"How are you feeling, Human?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_61","text":"Feeling a bit... tumescent, perhaps?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_62","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_62","text":"I suggest you stay quiet before I get really upset.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"mechashifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_63","text":"You should be grateful that you get to experience something like this, Human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_64","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_64","text":"Right. Thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_65","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_65","text":"After the massage, Mecha Shifty carries Shifty on its back and wheels off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom_n","bgArt":"commanderroom_n","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_66","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_66","text":"Finally, now I can rest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_67","text":"Commander!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rapi","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_68","text":"Master!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_69","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_69","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_70","text":"Where have you been all day? Don't you realize it's April Fool's Day? You should have stayed inside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_71","text":"We prepared something special for you. It took us a long time to set up!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_72","text":"Yes... a special event.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_73","text":"We worked really hard on it, and you weren't even here!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_74","text":"Yeah, we're really disappointed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_75","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_75","text":"You all were clearly planning on pranking me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_76","text":"N-no, we weren't!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_77","text":"But for real, where were you all day, Master?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolburstday_14_78","text":"Yeah. We didn't catch so much as a glimpse of you, and couldn't reach you either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolburstday_14_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:even